              "message" : "<p>Run the PGQL query to display 100 graph elements. In <code>MATCH (s)-[t]-&gt;(d)</code>, <code>s</code> is the source vertex, <code>t</code> the directed edge, and <code>d</code> the destination. <code>LIMIT</code> caps the returned elements.</p>\n<p>For more syntax examples, see the <a href=\"https://pgql-lang.org/\">PGQL specification</a> or the PGQL tutorial in the Getting Started notebook folder.</p>\n",
